'''Event Enemies''' are [[Enemy Units]] that only appear in event stages. Most of them do not have descriptions in the Enemy Guide. Prior to the [[Version 13.3 Update]], most Event Enemies weren't listed in the Enemy Guide at all, leaving their names only listed in event banners, if they even had one.

This category does not include [[:Category:Collaboration Event Enemies|Collaboration Event Enemies]].

==Trivia==
*Event enemies with Enemy Guide descriptions include [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s, [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]], [[Hermit Cat (Enemy)|Hermit Cat]], [[Mystic Mask Yulala]] and [[Master Uril (Enemy)|Master Uril]].
*[[Ghost Doge]], [[Ghost Snache]] and [[Ghost Baa Baa]] all appear in [[The Haunted 1LDK]], a [[Stories of Legend]] stage, but don't have descriptions in the Enemy Guide.
*[[Super Metal Hippoe]], [[CyberFace]] and [[Angel Fanboy]] were considered event enemies before they appeared in Stories of Legend. Several of the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] also used to be event-exclusive (albeit for a much shorter time), including [[Cerberus Kids]], [[Aku Gory]], [[Miz Devil]], [[Medu-san]], [[Midnite D.]] and [[Deathkory]].